{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mei.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第一次基础课",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mei.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mei.second",
    "idolId": "mei",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "制作人，早上好～",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "早上好，愛依。先说一下今天的预定，可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "OK、OK，什么样的感觉～？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天打算让你把基础课都体验一遍。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "挖你的时候，你对偶像完全不了解吧？先从这儿开始。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "诶～不错嘛制作人！还配合着うち的情况来～♪",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，这就是制作人的工作。那，去练习场吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……好，怎么样？照你说的，先试了一遍。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她嘴上很轻松，其实一直在等评价。）",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "基础打得不错。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "节奏再稳一点。",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "先休息，别急。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "诶，真的？那还好～",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，第一节课能到这个程度已经很好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "嘿嘿，那うち下次要更好看一点♪"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "节奏啊～……那个有点难诶。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以才要练。不急。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "知道啦知道啦～嗯，那再来一次。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "诶，可以休息吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，一开始别太拼。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "那うち就，稍微歇一下～谢谢制作人♪"
      }
    }
  },
